  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f2d6c2cf91479871b9ae86e7c6a324b3, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryCampaign
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Phainon.Runtime::Phainon.StoryCampaign
  spec:
    title: OPERATION PHAINON
    subtitle: THE EXPEDITION INTO THE UNKNOWN
    introduction:
    - A young astronaut has been sent on an expedition across the stars.
    - Operation Phainon.
    - A solitary journey into the unknown, where one astronaut must survive an expedition through the endless darkness of deep space.
    - 'Your objective is simple: obtain the required scientific discoveries, complete your mission and find your way home.'
    - 'But why?


      That is for you to discover.'
    - As you explore the universe, your discoveries could revolutionise the world and transform humanity's understanding of the cosmos.
    - 'Yet science is only part of the mission.


      You are alone.'
    - 'Your spacecraft is your home. Your supplies are limited. Your decisions matter.


      Every system must be maintained, every journey carefully considered and every unexpected event survived.'
    - 'You may uncover discoveries that change humanity forever.


      But will you make it home?'
    - SURVIVAL IS JUST AS IMPORTANT AS SCIENCE.
    - WHICH WILL YOU CHOOSE?
    chapters:
    - id: chapter_1
      title: CHAPTER ONE   THE GIANT
      missionIds:
      - m01_jupiter
    missions:
    - id: m01_jupiter
      title: MISSION 01   JUPITER OBSERVATION
      subtitle: OPERATION PHAINON
      briefing: 'The mission computer has restarted. One instruction survives:


        Obtain close-range observation data of Jupiter from a stable orbit. Transmit when able.


        The rest of the flight plan, and most of the flight history, could not be read.'
      scenario:
